    "text": "Hello. My name is Ava. We meet our English group at six. There are four students in this group. What is your name?\n\nPlease sit here, Tom. This is my notebook. Is that your textbook? We can open our books and write our names. I can show you my note.\n\nYes. Listen to the sound. I can help you spell the name. The name is Ben. It has three letters. We can say the letters together.\n\nYes. The teacher can help us. We have ten minutes for a short task. Please read the note and then stand near the group. We can speak to the other students. The teacher shows us the next part. We can listen together. It is fine to ask for help.",
